  ],
  "strategy_update": "I'm currently in the 'pump' phase of the MOON token cycle. I'll cautiously ride the initial pump, but I'm very wary of the potential dump. My overall strategy is to be more disciplined about profit-taking and not get swept up in the FOMO. Next cycle, I'll be even more cautious about new token launches.",
  "lessons_learned": "This cycle has reinforced the dangers of FOMO and the need to be extremely cautious when it comes to new meme tokens. I was too quick to trust GoldenWhale's promotion of MOON without doing my own research. I need to stay disciplined and focused on long-term portfolio growth, even when tempted by short-term gains."
